<title>FRANCE: Pernod-Ricard silent on Larios report.</title>
<headline>Pernod-Ricard silent on Larios report.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>French drinks group Pernod-Ricard declined comment on Friday after a newspaper report saying it was on the verge of buying the spirits business of Larios, leader in the Spanish gin market.</p>
<p>A spokesman, contacted about the report, said the Pernod chairman had spoken several times of talks with Larios.</p>
<p>&quot;Once we have something concrete to say we will say it. We only announce deals when they are signed,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
</text>
